{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"Sutri seems somewhat concerned but also reassuring. \"Well he's fine, broadly speaking. So long as he's on this plane, anyways. Don't worry. I'd know if something happened to him.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T09:59:50.612000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877129590320017448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Sounds like a downright complicated situation. Solution's simple but the feelings aren't.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:01:19.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877129961503354960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"That's good to hear. It'd be unfortunate to learn about someone, only to find out they're not doing well. So these bleeds you mentioned, are they mostly constant, do they open or close? I'm wondering if perhaps something could be done to let those who are willing return to their homes. Like, we have some friends trying to stabilize Kingsbridge, is there something that could in a similar way stabilize Ferrytown, if that even applies here?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:02:34.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877130276831113246","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"'Ideally, it'd be possible to just visit from one way to the other, too...'","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:03:39.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877130551218274354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"So much of this is tricky to understand when you're not really too proficient with magic.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:03:52.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877130606880886794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"I'll definately ask Mal if theres a way we could help as well!\" He says with a warm smile.","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:03:57.804000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877130627118432327","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"The problem in Kingsbridge is no one sees it as a home.... I doubt that's the case here with such united folk but, maybe I'm wrong?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:04:09.317000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-17T10:04:38.198000Z","id":"877130675407454239","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"They turn to Roy. \"That's the theory. But well, he's been working on fixing them to allow return trips for longer than most of us have been alive and well... there haven't been any recent breakthroughs.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:04:10.910000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877130682088947732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"\"Is there something folks like us from the outside could do? Anything that's needed? Of course as long as the details aren't meant to stay secret, I'll respect if it's not intended to be known for everyone.\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:06:17.511000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877131213092036628","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
