{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852742259073744937","content":"They shrug. \"Not as far as I know. The leylines here are wacky, all the way to their core.\" They smile, as if trying to change the topic to somethign brighter. \"Anyways, what else did you want to know?\"","created_at":"2021-08-17T10:07:34.887000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877131537630511116","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
